      "text": [
        "1376 - وَقَالَ أَبُو جَعْفَرٍ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «وَقْتُ صَلاَةِ اَللَّيْلِ مَا بَيْنَ نِصْفِ اَللَّيْلِ إِلَى آخِرِهِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1376 - Imam Muhammad ibn Ali Al-Baqir (as) said:\n\"The time for the night prayer (salat al-layl) is from midnight until its end.\""
        ]
      }
